# whatitis: Complete Understanding of the POSTL Project

Generated on 2026-07-29 after reviewing the project at `D:\postl`.

## 1. High-level identity

POSTL is a web application positioned as a premium "Content Intelligence OS" for creators, marketers, founders, and social media users. Its purpose is to turn a user prompt or idea into optimized content for different platforms and formats. The app combines a polished React frontend, Firebase authentication/storage, and a Node/Express AI orchestration backend. There is also a separate Python Flask local AI server intended as a local/offline generation option.

The product language throughout the project is intentionally premium and dramatic: "creator command center", "neural studio", "POSTL Core", "Ferrari aesthetic", "Content Intelligence OS", "Brand Voice DNA", and similar phrases. The main practical functionality is AI-assisted content generation with platform, format, topic, tone, creativity, variants, result display, history, feedback, and analytics.

