## 26. Final understanding

POSTL is a premium AI content generation platform. The frontend is a polished React dashboard with authentication, a creator studio, generated result presentation, post history, and usage analytics. The backend authenticates Firebase users, validates generation requests, performs prompt refinement, uses platform/tone/content-type prompt engineering, calls a local Ollama model by default, optionally falls back to Hugging Face, cleans output, scores likely engagement, generates strategy metadata, caches repeated requests, and exposes routes for local/serverless use. The local Python server is an additional GPT-2-based generation engine, but it is not wired into the current Express generation path. The project has a strong product vision and substantial UI/AI logic, but some configuration, tests, and documentation are out of sync with the current code.
